The probe counts the two line shapes in the record the bound writes beside an item's own event stream: the 82 trims the
bound wrote, and the 0 repeat lines the repeat rule wrote — before this change it wrote none, and that is the defect
(issue #831). The script is the item's own (`items/831/probe-repeat-record.sh`); the copy of its output in the item
directory is `probe-repeat-record.log`.
